{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "orgflow-full-usecases",
    "name": "OrgFlow — Complete Use Cases (Serial)",
    "description": "# OrgFlow API — Complete Serial Use Cases\n\nRun folders **top to bottom** (01 → 12).\n\n## Before you start\n1. Backend running: `http://localhost:5000`\n2. Postman → Settings → **Cookies = ON**\n3. Stripe CLI (for folder 10): `stripe listen --forward-to localhost:5000/api/webhooks/stripe`\n\n## Seed accounts (password for all: `Password123!`)\n| Role | Email |\n|------|-------|\n| Platform Admin | admin@orgflow.com |\n| Org Admin (Acme) | admin@acme.com |\n| Member (Acme) | member@acme.com |\n| Org Admin (Nordic Soft) | admin@nordicsoft.com |\n\nAfter each Login, cookies `orgflow_access` and `orgflow_refresh` are stored automatically.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000/api" },
    { "key": "organizationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "planId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "newPlanId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "memberId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pendingId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "checkoutUrl", "value": "" },
    { "key": "inviteToken", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 — Health Check",
      "description": "Confirm API is reachable before testing use cases.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01.1 API health",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('API healthy', () => {",
                "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().success).to.be.true;",
                "});"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — Public Plans (before login)",
      "description": "Anyone can see active plans used during registration.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "02.1 List active subscription plans",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('Plans listed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                "const plans = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                "pm.test('At least one plan', () => pm.expect(plans.length).to.be.above(0));",
                "if (plans[0]) pm.collectionVariables.set('planId', plans[0].id);"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/plans"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 — Authentication (Platform Admin)",
      "description": "Login, session, refresh, profile for Platform Admin.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "03.1 Login — Platform Admin (admin@orgflow.com)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('Logged in as PLATFORM_ADMIN', () => {",
                "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.user.role).to.eql('PLATFORM_ADMIN');",
                "});"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@orgflow.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03.2 Get current user (me)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('Current user returned', () => {",
                "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.email).to.eql('admin@orgflow.com');",
                "});"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03.3 Refresh access token",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": ["pm.test('Token refreshed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03.4 Invalid login (should fail)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "type": "text/javascript",
              "exec": [
                "pm.test('Invalid credentials rejected', () => {",
                "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('INVALID_CREDENTIALS');",
                "});"
              ]
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@orgflow.com\",\n  \"password\": \"WrongPassword!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
